American esports commanding a millions of dollars in prize money strong

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:28.280
viewership and millions of copies sold. Now its lucky to get 10,000 viewers on

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.080
Twitch on a good day. This is how Halo rose to the top of the

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.160
esports world.

