around they were part of the unpopular loadout system from Reach.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:07.080
"There has been something done to this game that wasn't enjoyable

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:15.100
the matchmaking experience has to be better. The game has to be more fun and

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:19.980
obviously you know I'm gonna sit here and ranks, spectator mode, make the game not

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:24.180
suck go back to the formula. The online experience has to be better you don't

00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:27.720
have to reinvent the wheel for your matchmaking experience when Halo 2

