00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:42.600
dead.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:48.460
But there is a happy ending to this story in 2014 343 put out the Master

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:52.280
Chief collection along with a port of Halo 2's multiplayer mode which

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:55.080
brought a lot of lapsed pros and fans back into the scene.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:12:00.280
"It's extremely smooth it felt very clean and the 60 frames per second all that sprint was

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:04.360
taken out of the game which means a lot more setup based game types are being

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:04.980
played."

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:26.960
(Casting)

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.120
The game wasn't perfect,

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:32.460
and took a long time to get fixed but it was a step in the right direction

00:12:32.460 --> 00:12:35.720
one that 343 followed up with Halo 5 just a year later.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.320
Halo 5 replaced armor abilities with spartan abilities, always on traits

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:43.140
that every player had constant access to with the option to turn individual

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:47.580
powers on or off for competitive play. It got back to default starts back to solid

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:50.960
map design and away from killstreak gimmicks trimmed from CoD.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.860
It was a return to form.

00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:55.140
"The shooting is definitely really really

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:59.820
like easy but the movement makes it much harder to shoot than like any other like

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:04.520
Halo I feel like. And then plus MLG coming back they run events so well it's

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:08.680
a blessing to have MLG it's crazy. MLG events are events one of a kind."

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:14.780
"Halo 5 brought us the first ever Halo title with a live spectate option this

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:20.180
means you can jump into any players live film and watch on a 1 minute delay

