00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:39.420
us to join in any lobby and watch without that one minute delay not only that it

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:43.900
has enhanced viewer information on the user interface to see each player shield,

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:47.580
whether they have a powerup, what weapons they have nades they have selected,

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:51.700
with the right guidance and hopefully with some more tweaking in Halo infinite

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:57.200
