00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:01.440
Halo 5 also had esports support from Microsoft on day one following up the

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.400
two seasons of the Halo championship series they played on the Master Chief

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:08.380
collection. After that the league moved to Halo 5 and Microsoft boosted the

